      "message": "fix(fixtures): refuse unsafe profile arithmetic before editing\n\nValidate arc calculations, mesh coordinates, and conservative collision bounds before a profile command exists. Pin refusal without fixture, history, or save/open corruption. Verify v64 migration preserves main v63 break-through data and older defaults.\n\nFixes #744",
